      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 720,
        "content": "## n8n2Hubspot\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow starts when a chat message is received and passes the message to an AI Agent. The agent uses a DeepSeek chat model and simple memory to maintain conversational context, and it can call a HubSpot tool to create a company record based on the chat request.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the chat trigger so users can send messages to the workflow.\n- Add and verify credentials for the DeepSeek chat model used by the AI Agent.\n- Add and verify HubSpot credentials with permission to create company records.\n- Review the AI Agent instructions so it knows when and how to use the HubSpot company creation tool.\n\n### Customization\n\nCustomize the AI Agent prompt, memory window size, and HubSpot company fields to match the information you want to collect from chat users."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c96908fa-9b3e-4a30-b629-b64ea703c9ed",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
